   "stimulus_html": "<figure class=\"unnumbered\">\n<img src=\"exercises/media/e4e96fb2d99311f7.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n<figcaption>(credit: modification of work from Pinterest)</figcaption>\n</figure>",
   "stem_html": "<p>A 155-g baseball is incoming at a velocity of 25 m/s. The batter hits the ball as shown in the image. The outgoing baseball has a velocity of 20 m/s at the angle shown.</p>\n<p>What is the magnitudde of the impulse acting on the ball during the hit?</p>",
